                        <p class="c-article-title__super">Microbe-Microbe and Microbe-Host Interactions</p><h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">RNA-seq reveals cooperative metabolic interactions between two termite-gut spirochete species in co-culture</h1>
